  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Anomaly</strong></p><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Far range. On a success, <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to suddenly manipulate the gravity around them. They take <strong>d8+2</strong> kinetic damage using your Proficiency and are forcefully pulled into Close range of you.</p><p><strong>Escalation:</strong> On a success, you may <strong>give the GM a Fear</strong>. If you do, increase the damage to <strong>d12+5</strong> kinetic damage using your Proficiency. In addition the target is temporarily <em>Restrained</em>.</p>",
